fields.value:
{{Morphnotes
| name = Firefly
| desc = All ability effects persist upon losing the ability.
}}
{{Stealnotes
| name = Firefly
| desc = All ability effects persist upon losing the ability.
}}

 * {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
** Interrupts Batrider's {{M|channeling}} abilities.
** {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|batrider_firefly}}
*** Grants {{M|unobstructed movement}} for the entire duration.
*** {{Symbol|Trees}}
**** [[Trees]] within the damage radius centered around Batrider are destroyed.
*** Recasting the ability refreshes its duration and creates another independent flame trail.
** {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|batrider_displacement_buff}}
*** Recasting the ability refreshes its duration.
*** Applies the following ability effects in {{#var:Firefly basic2}}-second intervals, starting {{#var:Firefly basic2}} seconds upon buff application:
**** {{Symbol|a|Up}}
***** Increases the total bonus {{M|movement speed}} by {{calc|v1*{{#var:Firefly basic2}}|v1={{#var:Firefly type1 value1}}|%}} ({{Symbol|bonus t1r}} {{ValueColor||{{calc|v1*{{#var:Firefly basic2}}|v1={{#var:Firefly type1 value1 tal}}|%}}|10tal}}) per interval.

* {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
** Deals {{calc|v1*{{#var:Firefly basic1}}|v1={{#var:Firefly value2}}}} ({{Symbol|bonus t2r}} {{ValueColor||{{calc|v1*{{#var:Firefly basic1}}|v1={{#var:Firefly value2 tal}}}}|15tal}}) {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} per interval.
** The damage intervals have the following properties:
*** {{Symbol|DoT|On}} {{Symbol|DoT|Off}} {{Symbol|DoT|Off}} ... {{Symbol|DoT|Off}} {{Symbol|DoT|Off}}
**** The first interval starts 0.1 seconds after the damage application, with a 0.4-second duration.
*** {{Symbol|DoT|Off}} {{Symbol|DoT|On}} {{Symbol|DoT|Off}} ... {{Symbol|DoT|Off}} {{Symbol|DoT|Off}}
**** Subsequent intervals have a {{#var:Firefly basic1}}-second duration in between.

* {{Symbol|fx|v}}
** When the ability ends, the entire flame trail disappears at once as well.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Firefly icon0}}
| desc = Batrider takes to the skies, moving increasingly fast and laying down a trail of flames from the air. The fire damages any enemies it touches and destroys trees below Batrider. Maximum movement speed bonus is reached at the end of Firefly's duration.
}}
* {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
** Deals a total of {{calc|v1*({{#var:Firefly value3}}+0.5)|v1={{#var:Firefly value2}}}} ({{Symbol|bonus t2r}} {{ValueColor||{{calc|v1*({{#var:Firefly value3}}+0.5)|v1={{#var:Firefly value2 tal}}}}|15tal}}) damage ([[before reductions]]) within the area for the entire duration.

* {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
** Upon Batrider's {{M|death}} while the ability is active, the existing flame trail remains for its entire duration.
*** {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|batrider_firefly}} remains on Batrider's [[HUD]], and are now only responsible for keeping the flame trail up.
*** If Batrider respawns before the trail expires, the ability neither grants {{M|unobstructed movement}} nor creates another flame trail.

