fields.value:
{{Splblocknotes
| name = Flaming Lasso
| desc = {{Symbol|bonus agh}} Does not proc [[Spell Block]] sources on the secondary affected target.
}}
{{Splreflectnotes
| name = Flaming Lasso
| desc = {{Symbol|bonus agh}} Does not proc [[Spell Reflection]] sources on the secondary affected target.
}}

 * Applies the following ability effects until the lasso is broken:
** {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|batrider_flaming_lasso_self}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
*** {{M|Disarm}}
*** Overrides most and other {{M|forced movement}} sources.
** {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
*** Recasting the ability on a different {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted enemy creates an independent lasso instance.
*** Affects the following units:
**** {{M|Couriers}}
*** The ability effects are applied as follows:
***# {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|batrider_flaming_lasso}}
***#* {{Symbol|Forced Movement}}
***#** Pulls the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted enemy {{#var:Flaming Lasso value2}}-distance behind Batrider.
***#** Cannot be cast on, but can pull the following units:
***#*** {{M|Hidden}} units.
***#*** {{M|Invulnerable}} units.
***#* {{M|Stun}} 
***#* {{M|Phase movement}}.
***# {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|batrider_flaming_lasso_damage}}
***#* Applies up to {{calc|floor(v1/{{#var:Flaming Lasso value3}})|v1={{#var:Flaming Lasso value4}}}} ({{Symbol|bonus t4r}} {{ValueColor||{{calc|floor(v1/{{#var:Flaming Lasso value3}})|v1={{#var:Flaming Lasso value4 tal}}}}|25tal}}) {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} instances for the entire duration.

* {{Symbol|Projectile|LinkBreak}}
** The following conditions break the lasso:
*** {{M|Teleport}} sources either moving Batrider or moving the debuff-affected enemy unit {{Code|> {{#var:Flaming Lasso value1}}-distance}}.
**** Upon Batrider's or the affected enemy unit's {{M|death}}.
**** Specifically being affected by the following abilities:
***** {{A|Centaur Warrunner|Hitch A Ride}}
***** {{A|Primal Beast|Pulverize}}
***** {{A|Pudge|Dismember}}
***** {{A|Tusk|Walrus Kick}}
<hr>
* {{cf|aghnotes}} [[File:Dota2 Cast Range to AoE Visualization icon-7-1.png|84px]][[File:Dota2 Cast Range to AoE Visualization icon-7-2.png|84px]]
** Now affects another nearest allied hero, of the enemy's {{M|faction}}, within {{ValueColor||{{#var:Flaming Lasso type3 value1 agh}}|agh}} radius centered around the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted enemy hero [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|P|21px]] .
*** Hence, it can affect another enemy hero at max {{Symbol|bonus cas}} {{Symbol|bonus aoe}} {{ValueColor||{{#expr:{{#var:Flaming Lasso cast range}}+{{#var:Flaming Lasso type3 value1 agh}}}}|agh}}-distance away with the [[cast range]] and [[effect radius]].
** Considers {{M|illusions}} and {{M|creep-heroes}} as heroes, {{M|clones}} as creeps.
** The secondary lasso is indepenent of the primary lasso. When the primary lasso is broken, the secondary target remains affected.
*** Does not search for enemy {{M|Couriers}}.
** {{Symbol|bonus aoe}}
*** The ability has a 0-effect radius by default, enemy units within the same coordinates may be affected at the same time without the ability upgrade.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Flaming Lasso icon0}}
| desc = Lassoes an enemy and drags them in Batrider's wake. Dragged units cannot move, attack, or use abilities.  Teleporting or blinking will break the lasso.
}}
* Deals up to {{#var:Flaming Lasso basic1}} {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} ([[before reductions]]) for the entire duration.

